===Etymology===
From {{etyl|es|en}} {{m|es|dengue}}, 1828.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdɛŋɡi/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# An [[acute]] [[febrile]] [[disease]] of the (sub)[[tropic]]s caused by a [[flavivirus]], transmitted by ''[[Aedes]]'' [[mosquito]]es, and characterized by high [[fever]], [[rash]], [[headache]], and [[severe]] [[muscle]] and [[joint]] [[pain]].

====Synonyms====
* [[breakbone fever]]
* [[dandy fever]]
* [[dengue fever]]

